DESCRIPTION:Milonga: La Milonguita Nota Negra \n----------\nThe darker the 
 night\, the sweeter the dance.\nEntrée 2 € — donations welcome\n\n- A
 peritif - 18:00 -19:00\n\nPRACTICA\nA Taste of Tango\n\nA relaxed space to
  practice together\, share ideas\, and ask anything you’d like.\nA first
  sip of rhythm- a slow awakening for the senses\n\n- Main Course - 19:00
 –22:00\nLa Milonguita Nota Negra\n\nA rich blend of Argentine classics a
 nd hidden gems\, carefully seasoned by \n- DJ ZOYA Berlin\n\nBest enjoyed 
 with drinks\, served alongside with tempting bites \;)…\n\n Lean in. Let
  the night melt on your tongue\, each step a lingering bite of dark chocol
 ate\, each glance a sip of red wine\, let your steps follow the flavor of 
 the music. \n\nNOIRcafé\, Graefestraße 82\n10967 Berlin\n----------\nQue
 lle: https://www.facebook.com/philip.kojo.96\n\nVeranstalter: Philip Kojo 
 \n\nhttps://www.hoy-milonga.com/berlin/de/milonga/486381/La-Milonguita-Not
